{"hash": "19401fecb0e3c55a", "kind": "tts", "payload": {"text": "Thank you, Oliver. This is the Barclays fraud-prevention team, calling on a recorded line. I'm sorry to call you unexpectedly \u2014 we've spotted an urgent transaction on your account that may be fraudulent, and I'd like to check it with you. Is now an okay moment to talk?"}, "prev_hash": "942b7e1d4d1fa044", "seq": 6, "session_id": "call_384d9c9eec", "ts": 1784892912415}
{"hash": "d7eb66bce63c920c", "kind": "asr", "payload": {"text": "Ya sure, i'm free."}, "prev_hash": "19401fecb0e3c55a", "seq": 7, "session_id": "call_384d9c9eec", "ts": 1784892933439}
{"hash": "956d50124076e604", "kind": "state", "payload": {"after": "human_intro", "to": "awaiting_verification"}, "prev_hash": "d7eb66bce63c920c", "seq": 8, "session_id": "call_384d9c9eec", "ts": 1784892933442}
{"hash": "11113419521805ba", "kind": "tts", "payload": {"text": "Thank you, I appreciate it. First, just so you can be completely sure this really is Barclays and to confirm your identity, please open your Barclays app \u2014 you'll see a verification code we've just sent you. Could you read that code back to me? To be clear, I will never ask for your PIN, your password or your full card number \u2014 this app code is only to confirm it's really you."}, "prev_hash": "956d50124076e604", "seq": 9, "session_id": "call_384d9c9eec", "ts": 1784892933444}
{"hash": "abe258250358756e", "kind": "asr", "payload": {"text": "Sure uh the otp is eight seven eight five five."}, "prev_hash": "11113419521805ba", "seq": 10, "session_id": "call_384d9c9eec", "ts": 1784892967065}
{"hash": "bd4e772e4bf6e2ea", "kind": "state", "payload": {"attempt": 1, "event": "verification_failed"}, "prev_hash": "abe258250358756e", "seq": 11, "session_id": "call_384d9c9eec", "ts": 1784892967070}
{"hash": "61dcec27d2646efc", "kind": "tts", "payload": {"text": "That code does not match what we sent to your app. Please open the Barclays app notification and read the code exactly. This code only verifies this call \u2014 we will never ask for your PIN, full card number or password."}, "prev_hash": "bd4e772e4bf6e2ea", "seq": 12, "session_id": "call_384d9c9eec", "ts": 1784892967072}
{"hash": "5037e66edd1cd789", "kind": "asr", "payload": {"text": "Uh, it's eight seven eight five five."}, "prev_hash": "61dcec27d2646efc", "seq": 13, "session_id": "call_384d9c9eec", "ts": 1784892987748}
